{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"The dataset door (spectrum S2): register a local corpus in place with kind, format, row count, content hash (FNV), read-time holdout policy, and mode (stream/snapshot). Records land in the runtime library's datasets record and registry.json re-renders for the trainer. Registering an anchor flips anchor_status on models waiting for it. Hub datasets come through this same door later; nothing acquires data on its own.","import":"use ndata::dataobject::DataObject;\nuse ndata::dataarray::DataArray;\nuse flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse flowlang::flowlang::system::time::time;","params":[{"desc":"Registry name - lowercase [a-z0-9-_]; the handle MODEL_MIX and recipes use. Built-in pool names (fresh/replay/standard) are refused.","name":"name","type":"String"},{"desc":"Local file or directory holding the rows. Referenced in place - never copied, never rewritten.","name":"source","type":"String"},{"desc":"cpt | sft | eval | persona | anchor. An anchor registration flips anchor_status on any model record waiting for it.","name":"kind","type":"String"},{"desc":"jsonl | txt | parquet | auto (detect from the files present).","name":"format","type":"String"},{"desc":"Read-time held-out policy: every Nth row is reserved and never trained (0 = none). The persona split pattern; files are never rewritten.","name":"holdout_every","type":"Integer"},{"desc":"snapshot (frozen - hash recorded, drift is a tamper alarm) or stream (append-only - hash stays rolling, drift is the point).","name":"mode","type":"String"}],"returntype":"JSONObject","type":"rust"},"id":"srzlok1a0178434d1k1","readers":[],"time":1787100940574,"username":"system","writers":[]}